    "expression_latex": "\\lim \\inf_{T \\to +\\infty} \\frac{R^{\\pi}(T)}{ \\log(T)}  \\geq c(\\theta) = \\sum_{(k,k^*) \\in E} \\frac{ \\mu^{\\star} - \\mu_k}{I_{\\min}(\\theta_k, \\theta^{\\star})}",
